<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>web-color ${APP_VERSION}</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: ${APP_COLOR};
      color: #fff;
      font: 500 1rem/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
    }
    main { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 4.5rem); margin: 0 0 .5rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto auto; gap: .25rem 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
    dt { text-align: right; opacity: .75; }
    dd { margin: 0; text-align: left; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>${APP_NAME}</h1>
    <p>Si ves este color, la variable de entorno llegó hasta el navegador.</p>
    <dl>
      <dt>APP_NAME</dt><dd>${APP_NAME}</dd>
      <dt>APP_VERSION</dt><dd>${APP_VERSION}</dd>
      <dt>APP_COLOR</dt><dd>${APP_COLOR}</dd>
    </dl>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
